      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As an addendum to part 1.a., the debate of having volunteer moderators might not be the best choice for VRChat, since having reliable and paid Trust & Safety team holds VRChat as a platform with more integrity. However, if a system were ever to come into place to allow volunteer moderation, an incentive could be for extending the volunteer's VRChat Plus subscription.\nAddendum to part 1.b., Zendesk should connect to the in-platform report system so that way, it won't be obscured. When submitting a report ticket, have the platform take our player logs that are requested, so we don't have to go digging in LocalLow for it. Quest users can't even access player logs at all!\nAddendum to part 3., for reliable users who volunteer to moderate public lobbies should be given the incentive for free extensions to their VRChat Plus subscriptions.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
