      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hi, I wanted to re-visit this thread and seek it as either Complete/Closed, as most of the concerns listed in my thread have been addressed as best as possible.\n\nI want to thank VRChat's dev team, and the Trust & Safety team for implementing the feedback, and addressing these concerns through that impementation. This thread was written in mid 2022.\n\nReport reasons are now more concise, both in-game and through website tickets. ✅️ (Personally I wish there was still the reason for reporting an Underage user, but there is a more popular Canny post for this)\n\nGroups were new and have been heavily improved with managing, organizing, and moderation. This addresses a user's preference to rather go to a Group instance rather than Public if they want a more moderated experience. ✅️\n\nAge Verification has been implemented. More power for addressing safety. ✅️\n\nTrust & Safety will now send an in-game notification if an in-game report was reviewed and was successful. E-mail responses are more concise. ✅️\n\nReporting in-game now carries over metadata about the player, and reason for reporting, if the report instead requires a moderation ticket. Excellent win! ✅️\n\nI'm quite satisfied with the moves that have been done since the creation of this post, to improve Safety in VRChat.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
